Acknowledgements
----------------

This integration is a rewrite. It replaces the custom component
MrSleeps/Juwel-HeliaLux-Home-Assistant-Custom-Component
(https://github.com/MrSleeps/Juwel-HeliaLux-Home-Assistant-Custom-Component,
Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2022 Mr Sleeps) and keeps its domain (juwel_helialux),
its configuration keys and its unique IDs so existing installations can switch over.
No source code was taken from it or from moretea/pyHelialux, on which it is based;
thanks to both for the groundwork on the lamp's local web interface.

The Juwel word mark in custom_components/juwel_helialux/brand/ and assets/ is the
official logo of Juwel Aquarium, used only to identify the supported device.

